<description>&lt;p&gt;Drone strikes have hit a United Nations building and residential areas in Khartoum, killing four people and threatening humanitarian operations, while RSF forces assaulted aid offices in Nyala and a shelter in West Kordofan, causing civilian casualties. New defections include the RSF counterintelligence chief, a commander and a group joining the Sudanese army in Khartoum, indicating shifting loyalties within the conflict. Ethiopia has offered to host inclusive Sudan peace talks and proposes a national unity government, but Sudan rejected the offer and questioned Ethiopia's neutrality. The war produced 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNc2c5YVR5ejB2ZlN3RC1wNXVoSUtmc3hsems4MnJDN0pZeWpXaGhEcl96QTVCb3pzNlpoaGhxZVh0OHg2UUw5cnFkSHh2MGpxNklzTGtCZE5Cd2FvUnFJT1ctVTdOZjhOMG9JQ2JkdDRIdkNpR05WQjdUMmRQUVowdmFqaWdFdVdSbENkWUI4ZURmMFpXVEFTbFVB?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPbzZKQWNZNGU1dUoyX0F4Xy00WUpnWjV4QUxyZlUzNk5YekFfMG5tS3NrMnhHVzlWNXU0Rm5NYXdYdHRhSGpneGhUTG5VZ0hxaTFLWHJVb05pM0owNzh3MWtQMWk2d3lVeU4tYmdCZFBxZF9MUXoxdmFwTUEtLWVXdXVKZXdIdWNWTGQzbEVkSVVNM2JhRTQ5M291Vzd3Vm9JanMyekk2Z19zYzdRRXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOX0s2WW9GQnNrUS1IcGtfYTd0Uk16YkJqQ1BFNTZWbXV1SVNfSUQzeWx3c3RPaFhyQ1Q5eWdUUlk0b200ci0xcW9obG9MdmhsNUdyWFVpcWdPWkVCTEQ2QTVBcTVZd1hBRFpxbTVuZUNkdzdmN1Axd0VHRHllWmdjSVhBcUxVclFYMGlxYm04a1UxZjIwaXp6cWIzSTNmdDk3RlZ3RnFNd3FRNzMzZTVN?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiU0FVX3lxTE5tNjBwcExyV0ItdXlPTWJiM0Z5YnkyOGdwVXRHRUpRM0VfcEpWTl